识体系：BlockId 类型层次", "description": "学习 BlockId 的 sealed abstract class 设计，理解17种子类型的用途(RDD/Shuffle/Broadcast/TaskResult/Stream/Temp等)。这是整个存储系统的'地址空间'，所有操作都通过 BlockId 定位数据。", "nodeIds": ["file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/BlockId.scala"]}, {"order": 3, "title": "存储级别配置：StorageLevel 多维度设计", "description": "理解 StorageLevel 的5维配置(disk/memory/offHeap × serialized/deserialized × replication=1-3)，以及如何通过位标志编码优化序列化性能和内存占用。", "nodeIds": ["file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/StorageLevel.scala"]}, {"order": 4, "title": "核心门面：BlockManager 的职责与依赖关系", "description": "深入理解 BlockManager 作为 Facade 的设计：它组合了 MemoryStore/DiskStore/DiskBlockManager/BlockInfoManager/BlockTransferService 等10个子组件。掌握 doPut() 写路径(加锁→存内存→降级磁盘→异步复制)和 get() 读路径(本地→远程→同主机短路优化)的核心流程。", "nodeIds": ["file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/BlockManager.scala", "file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/BlockInfoManager.scala"]}, {"order": 5, "title": "内存存储引擎：MemoryStore 的渐进式展开与 LRU 驱逐", "description": "学习 MemoryStore 如何管理堆内/堆外内存：putIterator 的 Progressive Unrolling 机制(周期性检查内存阈值避免OOM)、LinkedHashMap 实现的近似LRU驱逐、以及 MemoryEntry 的两种格式(反序列化对象数组 vs 序列化字节缓冲)。", "nodeIds": ["file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/memory/MemoryStore.scala"]}, {"order": 6, "title": "磁盘存储引擎：DiskStore 与 DiskBlockManager 的协作", "description": "理解两级哈希目录布局如何解决单目录inode瓶颈，以及 DiskStore 的高阶函数 put(writeFunc) 设计、mmap 零拷贝读取、EncryptedBlockData 加密支持、Netty FileRegion/sendfile 优化。", "nodeIds": ["file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/DiskStore.scala", "file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/DiskBlockManager.scala"]}, {"order": 7, "title": "并发控制：BlockInfoManager 的读写锁与 Striping 设计", "description": "深入理解 BlockInfoManager 的并发安全设计：1024条 Striped<Lock> 减少竞争、读写锁语义(多读者独写者)、taskAttemptId 关联的自动锁释放防泄漏、lockNewBlockForWriting 的首次写入者获胜语义、downgradeLock 锁降级机制。", "nodeIds": ["file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/BlockInfoManager.scala"]}, {"order": 8, "title": "分布式协调：Driver 端 Master-Slave 架构", "description": "掌握 Driver-Executor 的 RPC 协作模型：BlockManagerMaster(Executor端代理)通过 RPC 调用 BlockManagerMasterEndpoint(Driver端中心端点)，后者维护全局 blockLocations 索引和 BlockManagerInfo 状态快照。理解心跳分离(独立 HeartbeatEndpoint)的性能优化意义。", "nodeIds": ["file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/BlockManagerMaster.scala", "file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/BlockManagerMasterEndpoint.scala", "file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/BlockManagerMasterHeartbeatEndpoint.scala", "file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/BlockManagerMessages.scala"]}, {"order": 9, "title": "副本策略：Random vs Basic (机架感知)", "description": "学习 Strategy 模式的应用：RandomBlockReplicationPolicy 使用 Floyd 算法做 O(n) 随机采样；BasicBlockReplicationPolicy 模拟 HDFS 的副本放置(同机架优先→跨机架→随机)，依赖 TopologyMapper 提供拓扑信息。理解 spark.storage.replication.policy 配置的作用。", "nodeIds": ["file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/BlockReplicationPolicy.scala", "file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/TopologyMapper.scala"]}, {"order": 10, "title": "优雅退役：BlockManagerDecommissioner 的双轨迁移", "description": "理解 Executor 退役时的数据迁移策略：(1) RDD缓存块单线程逐个复制到 peer 并删除；(2) Shuffle块使用生产者-消费者模型多线程并发上传(ConcurrentLinkedQueue + ShuffleMigrationRunnable)；(3) 无可用 peer 时回退到 FallbackStorage(HDFS)保证数据不丢失。", "nodeIds": ["file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/BlockManagerDecommissioner.scala", "file:core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/storage/FallbackStorage.scala"]}]}